  "body": "## Changelog\r\n* 61bc68896 Don't use /tmp when running goreleaser (#6090)\r\n* 8965639b3 [deps] Dependency update: web (#6075)\r\n* 3a14c7d02 Bump apiserver and x/net packages (#6087)\r\n* a848fb40b Pin runners for melange (#6086)\r\n* 49b3592fd Add server response to output when API calls fail (#6085)\r\n* 2ad3f0787 Add suppport for EC v3 template functions (#6082)\r\n* a6df0ab91 chore(go): update Go toolchain pins to 1.26.10 (#6083)\r\n* e92818325 fix(release): build native arm64 slice in darwin universal binary (#6081)\r\n* a6acbd0cb [deps] Dependency update: go and e2e validation infra (#6073)\r\n* 227bc0348 chore(deps): bump chainguard-dev/actions (#6080)\r\n* 2b89d6638 chore(deps): bump chainguard-dev/actions (#6078)\r\n* f48f67621 Use kurlsh/minio image in e2e MinIO install (#6077)\r\n* a13e29bd4 [deps] Dependency update: web (#6072)\r\n* 3118810ae [deps] Dependency update: web (#6058)\r\n* 803068c95 [deps] Dependency update: go (#6062)\r\n\r\n"
